@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-after-login
@refreshToken = replace-after-login
@invitationCode = copy-from-mailpit

### API readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Swagger document
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple",
  "client": {
    "type": "swagger",
    "version": "1.0"
  }
}

### Refresh (the old refresh token becomes invalid immediately)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Synchronize Monday and VR Mais (OrganizationAdmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/time-control/synchronizations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reprocess the complete 60-day administrative window
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/time-control/synchronizations?full=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List unassociated Monday identities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/time-control/external-identities?source=monday&mapped=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Associate identities and send an invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/time-control/people/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com",
  "displayName": "Person Example",
  "mondayIdentityId": "01999999-9999-7999-8999-999999999999",
  "vrMaisIdentityId": "01999999-9999-7999-8999-999999999998"
}

### Administrative history (maximum 60 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/time-control/history?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create an offline Revit grant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plugin/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": "revit",
  "pluginVersion": "2026.1.0",
  "installationId": "0f09e7a2-d292-4d3e-96be-4e7b193ce879"
}

### Public signing keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json
